      },
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p>All non-fiend creatures within 300 feet must attempt a @Check[type:will|dc:28] save or become @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 1}.</p>\n<p>A creature that critically fails and is within 60 feet of the Hound is instead @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 3} and @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.sDPxOjQ9kx2RZE8D]{Fleeing} for [[/r 1d4]] rounds or until it recovers from its frightened condition. Whether a creature succeeds or fails, the creature is temporarily immune to Bay for 24 hours.&nbsp;</p>"
        },
